#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:15
msgid ""
"This page is not maintained anymore and contains information referring to "
"features or functions from earlier versions of Kdenlive that are deprecated "
"or have been superseded by something else."
msgstr ""
"Táto stránka sa už neudržiava a obsahuje informácie týkajúce sa funkcií "
"alebo vlastností zo starších verzií Kdenlive, ktoré sú zastarané alebo boli "
"nahradené niečím iným."

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:19
msgid "Composite Transition"
msgstr "Kompozitný prechod"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:21
msgid ""
"The Composite transition combines the video data from two video tracks into "
"one. This transition is used in combination with Alpha Channel information "
"supplied by one of the :ref:`effects-alpha_mask_keying` or by the use of a :"
"doc:`/compositing/transitions/composite_transitions`. This Alpha Channel "
"data describes how the data from the two video tracks should be combined. "
"Until you define some alpha channel data using an :ref:`effects-"
"alpha_mask_keying` or a Wipe File, changes in the Composite transition "
"settings will have no visible effect."
msgstr ""
"Kompozitný prechod kombinuje video dáta z dvoch video stôp do jednej. Tento "
"prechod sa používa v kombinácii s informáciami o alfa kanáli poskytnutými "
"jedným z :ref:`effects-alpha_mask_keying` alebo použitím :doc:`/compositing/"
"transitions/composite_transitions`. Tieto dáta alfa kanála popisujú, ako sa "
"majú dáta z dvoch video stôp kombinovať. Kým nedefinujete nejaké dáta alfa "
"kanála pomocou :ref:`effects-alpha_mask_keying` alebo súboru vymazania, "
"zmeny v nastaveniach kompozitného prechodu nebudú mať žiadny viditeľný efekt."

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:23
msgid ""
"Note: The disadvantages of the **Composite** transition are: luma bleed, and "
"less precise position control. When compared to **Affine**, the "
"**Composite** transition, it does not support rotation or skewing but it is "
"much faster, albeit at the cost of luma bleed."
msgstr ""
"Poznámka: Nevýhody prechodu **Composite** sú: prenikanie jasu a menej presné "
"ovládanie polohy. V porovnaní s prechodom **Affine**, prechod **Composite** "
"nepodporuje rotáciu ani skreslenie, ale je oveľa rýchlejší, aj keď na úkor "
"prenikania jasu."

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:26
msgid "Alpha operations"
msgstr "Operácie alfa"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:32
msgid "Alpha operation options are *Over*, *And*, *Or* and *Xor*:"
msgstr "Možnosti operácií alfa sú *Over*, *And*, *Or* a *Xor*:"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:34
msgid "Operation **Over**"
msgstr "Operácia **Over**"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:36
msgid ""
"The clip with alpha information is located on the top track: the selected "
"color acquires transparency."
msgstr ""
"Klip s informáciami alfa sa nachádza na hornej stope: vybraná farba získava "
"priehľadnosť."

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:37
msgid ""
"The clip with alpha information is located on the bottom track: we see only "
"the top clip."
msgstr ""
"Klip s informáciami alfa sa nachádza na spodnej stope: vidíme iba horný klip."

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:42
msgid "Operation **And**"
msgstr "Operácia **And**"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:44
msgid ""
"The clip with alpha information is located on the top track: the selected "
"color becomes transparent."
msgstr ""
"Klip s informáciami alfa sa nachádza na hornej stope: vybraná farba sa stáva "
"priehľadnou."

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:45
msgid ""
"The clip with alpha information is located on the bottom track: everything "
"in the image becomes transparent, except for the selected color."
msgstr ""
"Klip s informáciami alfa sa nachádza na spodnej stope: všetko v obraze sa "
"stáva priehľadným, okrem vybranej farby."

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:50
msgid "Operation **Or** clears any alpha information"
msgstr "Operácia **Or** vymaže všetky informácie alfa"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:55
msgid "Operation **Xor**"
msgstr "Operácia **Xor**"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:57
msgid ""
"The clip with alpha information is located on the top track: everything in "
"the image becomes transparent, except for the selected color."
msgstr ""
"Klip s informáciami alfa sa nachádza na hornej stope: všetko v obraze sa "
"stáva priehľadným, okrem vybranej farby."

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:58
msgid ""
"The clip with alpha information is located on the bottom track: the selected "
"color acquires transparency."
msgstr ""
"Klip s informáciami alfa sa nachádza na spodnej stope: vybraná farba získava "
"priehľadnosť."

