#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:78
msgid "Tutorial 2 - composite transition and Blue Screen"
msgstr "Návod 2 - kompozitný prechod a modrá obrazovka"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:80
msgid ""
"Tutorial showing how to use the \"Blue screen\" function, composite "
"transition and :ref:`effects_and_filters` to animate one image moving over "
"another in the **Kdenlive** video editor."
msgstr ""
"Návod ukazujúci, ako použiť funkciu \"Modrá obrazovka\", kompozitný prechod "
"a :ref:`effects_and_filters` na animovanie pohybu jedného obrázka nad druhým "
"vo video editore **Kdenlive**."

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:82
msgid "https://youtu.be/M8hC5FbIzdE"
msgstr "https://youtu.be/M8hC5FbIzdE"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:86
msgid "Tutorial 3 - Video Masks"
msgstr "Návod 3 - Video masky"

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:88
msgid ""
"This tutorial uses the Composite transition and a custom video mask (a.k.a. "
"a Wipe File or `matte <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Matte_(filmmaking)>`__) "
"to create an effect where you can make it appear that one video is playing "
"on the screen of a still of a computer monitor."
msgstr ""
"Tento návod používa kompozitný prechod a vlastnú video masku (tiež nazývanú "
"súbor stierania alebo `matte <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Matte_(filmmaking)>`__) na vytvorenie efektu, kde môžete dosiahnuť, aby to "
"vyzeralo, akoby sa jedno video prehrávalo na obrazovke statického obrázka "
"monitora počítača."

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:90
msgid "The mask/matte is created with **GIMP**."
msgstr "Maska/matte je vytvorená v programe **GIMP**."

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:92
msgid "Save your mattes to :file:`/usr/share/kdenlive/lumas`."
msgstr "Uložte svoje mattes do :file:`/usr/share/kdenlive/lumas`."

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:94
msgid ""
"It would appear that you need to stop and restart **Kdenlive** in order for "
"it to pick up new matte/wipe files saved in the above folder."
msgstr ""
"Zdá sa, že je potrebné zastaviť a reštartovať **Kdenlive**, aby zaznamenal "
"nové súbory matte/vymazania uložené vo vyššie uvedenom priečinku."

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:96
msgid ""
"There appears to be a defect in this functionality which means that when the "
"composite is on 100% Opacity, the wipe file does not work. You need to "
"change it to 99% to make the effect kick in."
msgstr ""
"Zdá sa, že v tejto funkcii je chyba, čo znamená, že keď je kompozitný "
"prechod na 100% nepriehľadnosti, súbor vymazania nefunguje. Musíte ho zmeniť "
"na 99%, aby sa efekt prejavil."

#: ../../more_information/earlier_versions/composite.rst:98
msgid "https://youtu.be/FIpnGlRY27U"
msgstr "https://youtu.be/FIpnGlRY27U"

